Package: zathura-pdf-poppler
Version: @DEB_ZPP_V@
Architecture: @DEB_ARCH@
Maintainer: @DEB_MAINTAINER@
Section: X11/Wayland Apps
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://pwmt.org/projects/zathura-pdf-poppler/
Depends: zathura, libpoppler-glib8, libglib2.0-0, libcairo2, libgirara-gtk3-4
Description: PDF backend plugin for zathura (Poppler)
 A zathura backend plugin that renders PDF documents using Poppler's GLib
 bindings. Install alongside zathura to open PDF files. Loaded by zathura at
 runtime from its plugin directory.
